{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39988","headline":"寄华山司空侍郎二首 一 · 徐夤","name":"寄华山司空侍郎二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金阙争权竞献功，独逃徴诏卧三峰。\n鸡羣未必容於鹤，蛛网何繇捕得龙。\n清论尽应书国史，静筹皆可息边烽。\n风霜落满千林木，不近青青涧底松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39988.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39988","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}